Z||000002||TRL46202||03-26-2001||09:27 AM||||I would recomend West Coast Auto Transport (800) 700-1167. They are very good and very nice!!! and just had a car shipped "88GT" from CA to Indy ($600.00) fully insured and bonded. they own the transports. <P>Tom<P>Driver was a great guy too!!!||||reg||1
Z||000003||stimpy||03-26-2001||01:31 PM||||Just a tip, if you're not in an excruciating hurry, let them know.  I had my GT (non-running at the time) shipped from Tracy CA (central Cali) to OKC and only cost $300 because it was taking up a space that would have gone unused on the transporter. Still got to me in less hen a month from when I called it in, and saved over $200. ||||reg||1
